# Build et CI

Node 20+, npm 10+. Pas de Maven/Gradle/Python.

## Commandes essentielles

```bash
npm run dev          # tsx watch ./src/server.ts
npm run build        # tsc → lib/
npm test             # vitest run
npm run lint         # eslint src test
```

Pré-PR (ordre CI) : `npm run lint; npm run build; npm test`

Test ciblé : `npx vitest run test/label-policy.test.ts`

## Test manuel pipeline LLM

```bash
npx tsx --env-file=.env scripts/test-with-real-pr.ts https://github.com/owner/repo/pull/123
```

`.env` : `APP_ID`, `WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `PRIVATE_KEY`, `WEBHOOK_PROXY_URL`, `GROQ_API_KEY`, `GROQ_MODEL`

## CI (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`)

`npm ci` → lint → build → test (sur `push main` et `pull_request`).
